    "s4.h2t": "Water Pollution", "s4.h2p": "Waste dumped into rivers and seas poisons drinking water and kills aquatic life.",
    "s4.h3t": "Plastic Pollution", "s4.h3p": "Plastic breaks into tiny pieces that never disappear and are eaten by animals.",
    "s4.h4t": "Deforestation", "s4.h4p": "Forests are cleared for farmland, destroying habitats and increasing CO₂.",
