    "s4.h8t": "Improper Waste Disposal", "s4.h8p": "Burning or dumping rubbish pollutes soil, air, and water.",
    "s4.h9t": "Habitat Destruction", "s4.h9p": "Building over forests pushes animals out of their homes and causes extinction.",
